  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 701.11 “Occupant” means “occupant” as defined in RSA 78-A:3, XII. This term includes a person who pays for sleeping accommodations even though they do not use them.\n\nSource. #2205, eff 12-12-82; ss by #2504, eff 10-12-83; ss by #3181, eff 1-22-86; ss by #4061, eff 5-29-86; ss by #5399, eff 5-21-92 (See Revision Note at part heading for Rev 701); ss and moved by #6750, eff 5-19-98 (from Rev 701.14); moved by #6870 (from Rev 701.15), eff 10-20-98, EXPIRES: 10-20-06; ss by #8653, eff 6-8-06; ss by #10714, eff 11-7-14 (from Rev 701.12); ss by #13077, eff 7-25-20; ss by #14105, eff 10-29-24, EXPIRES: 10-29-34 (formerly Rev 701.14)",
